## Passage

{{throneOutcomeLine}}

{{factionThroneEcho}}

**You find** what the throne **hid**: not an **end** — a **deeper reach**, a **fold** in the axis where stone **learns** a **new cold**. The throne did **not** close the **axis**: in the **Heights**, the wound **opens** a pocket of ice so vast it **seems** a mountain — a **chamber** with snow for **ceiling**. **Debt** with **interest** in **wind**.
